e=\"text-align:justify;\"><b>Disclaimer:</b> By uploading these files, I\nmake no claim to ownership or copyright. These recordings have been acquired\nfrom publicly available sources on the Internet, and my goal has been to put\ntogether a collection of every available episode where possible. I will add to\nthese collections if I discover new episodes or if any new episodes become available.\nAdditionally, while I tried to put together a collection that contains the best\nversion of each episode that I could, there may be better copies of some\nrecordings available from collectors and dealers, and I encourage you to reach\nout to them if you are so inclined. <b>If\nthey are not in the public domain, notify me and they will be deleted.</b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b>","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.4","subject":"American Armed Forces Radio No 11","title":"American Armed Forces Radio No 11","uploader":"kackyJacky@protonmail.com","publicdate":"2021-03-24 07:44:49","addeddate":"2021-03-24 07:44:49","curation":"[curator]validator@archive.org[/curator][date]20210324074521[/date][comment]checked for malware[/comment]"},"reviews":[{"reviewtitle":"Herman Griffith","reviewbody":"http://afrtsarchive.blogspot.com/search/label/Herman%20Griffith\nGriffith, Herman: KGFJ, 1963-66. Herman's on-air moniker was \"God's gift to woman.\" He worked afternoon drive at KGFJ. \"Y100's” Scott Lowe from Philadelphia remembers hearing Herman in 1967 on AFN while in Germany.\nhttps://laradio.com/whereg.htm\nImages and about himhttp://webapp1.dlib.indiana.edu/images/item.htm?id=http://purl.dlib.indiana.edu/iudl/photos/VAC2427/PA003938\nKGFJ was very progressive for it's day having an integrated staff. Their staff included other legends like Magnificent Montague, Johnny Magnus, Herman Griffith, Jim Wood, and Hunter Hancock.\nhttps://tenwatts.blogspot.com/search?q=Herman+Griffith\n\n","stars":"5","reviewer":"radioannouncer","reviewdate":"2021-03-24 15:30:24","createdate":"2021-03-24 15:22:56","reviewer_itemname":"@radioannouncer"}],"server":"ia601804.us.archive.org","uniq":1926928415,"workable_servers":["ia601804.us.archive.org","ia801804.us.archive.org"]}